[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m First, let's substitute \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression and simplify it step by step.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 1. Compute \((75 + 117i)z\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75\cos \theta + 117i\cos \theta + 75i\sin \theta - 117\sin \theta) = 4(75\cos \theta - 117\sin \theta + i(117\cos \theta + 75\sin \theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 2. Compute \(\frac{96 + 144i}{z}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos \theta + 144i\cos \theta - 96i\sin \theta + 144\sin \theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos \theta + 144\sin \theta + i(144\cos \theta - 96\sin \theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 3. Combine the two results:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = 4(75\cos \theta - 117\sin \theta + i(117\cos \theta + 75\sin \theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96\cos \theta + 144\sin \theta + i(144\cos \theta - 96\sin \theta)).
