[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m The real part of the expression is \(324\cos \theta - 432\sin \theta\). To maximize this, we need to find the maximum value of the expression \(324\cos \theta - 432\sin \theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
