[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
