[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m First, let's simplify the expression by calculating the product and the quotient:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \]
