[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m Next, let's simplify \(\frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=190305)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = (24 + 36i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
